!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single cells were suspended in calcium- and magnesium-free PBS containing 0.04% weight/volume BSA. Then Cells were added to each channel. After generation of GEMs, reverse transcription reactions were engaged barcoded full-length cDNA followed by the disruption of emulsions using the recovery agent and cDNA clean up with DynaBeads Myone Silane Beads (Thermo Fisher Scientific). Subsequently, the amplified cDNA was fragmented, end-repaired, A-tailed,  and index adaptor ligated and library amplification.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries  were prepared with Chromium Single cell 3’ Reagent v3 Kits according to the manufacturer’s protocol.
!Sample_data_processing = The Cell Ranger software pipeline provided by 10×Genomics was used to demultiplex cellular barcodes, map reads to the genome and transcriptome using the STAR aligner, and down-sample reads as required to generate normalized aggregate data across samples, producing a matrix of gene counts versus cells
